<section id="about" class="py-28 px-6 scroll-mt-20 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background accent -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left heading column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <span class="section-label mb-4 inline-block">Who We Are</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading mb-6">About<br />Dattam Labs</h2>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right content column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          At Dattam Labs, we build agentic AI applications that help organizations interact with complex data in natural, intuitive ways. Our agentic engineering approach combines LLMs, information retrieval systems, and domain-specific tooling to create autonomous systems that analyze, visualize, and act on data without constant human intervention.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          From open data platforms for governments to climate risk analysis tools, our work sits at the intersection of data engineering and AI. We specialize in building end-to-end systems — curating datasets, designing agentic workflows, and shipping production-grade applications backed by robust DevOps infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We believe in building technology where everyone involved has something to gain. If you are looking to harness your data with agentic AI or need a team that can take a project from data pipeline to production, we'd love to collaborate.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-8 pt-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">4+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Years Experience</div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-12 bg-gray-200"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">10+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Projects Delivered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-px h-12 bg-gray-200"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900" style="font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">6</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Trusted Clients</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
